{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"370339c9a6cb20ea1e577f7b3a79482d06fb56a6d8a5f70547728edb479655c8","ja":"やっぱり怖いものは……","zh":"害怕的东西果然还是……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"ee5223885e600cee8ce9d058ac98f9795e9b82f36d22ccd5aa7bd7d86c982125","ja":"あずささんが元気になってくれて良かったです♪\n……あれ？","zh":"梓小姐恢复了精神真是太好了♪\n……咦？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"d2b32c26fabfb169d93c82edc52e6fe49276232f8db1e1bef2cb08309ef2b553","ja":"「じゃあ三浦さんと北上さんの……は」\n「はい、しようとしたんですけど……で」","zh":"「那三浦小姐和北上小姐的……呢」\n「是的，本来打算做……但是……」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"3d8961c4144125e87d377643288eb82a04c5bcd5a510880a00f64d04da8943c9","ja":"お疲れさまで～す！\n私たちのこと、何か話してましたか～？","zh":"辛苦啦～！\n刚才在聊我们的什么事吗～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"9cb81739b744828a27551fba05235f651fb2e8f0ce0e7aa0fb19778bf798bdfd","ja":"「あ、すみません。実はさっきのドッキリ、暗闇で\nスタッフがおふたりを驚かすはずでしたが……」","zh":"「啊，不好意思。其实刚才的整蛊，本来应该是工作人员\n在黑暗中吓二位一跳的，结果……」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"415591915d147fd7ebe50d8b8c3eb725f6f65d7741dcd2d716e72ecc26abf405","ja":"「失敗してしまって。幽霊役のスタッフが言うには、\n何かに足を引っ張られて、転んでしまったって」","zh":"“搞砸了。听扮演幽灵的工作人员说，\n好像被什么东西拽住了脚，结果摔倒了”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"e31b7dcaf83377bc2b357025adf49d0c61aa52086003922d457d69ce0efbc46e","ja":"ええっ！？　だ、大丈夫でしたか～！？","zh":"咦！？没、没事吧～！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"2906f03321c3b35cdccbe9be701fd76ffc148b6d21edde939f1ccd336cfee7e2","ja":"「ケガはないようです。ただ、その場所に他の人は\nいなかったので、誰にひっぱられたのか……」","zh":"「看起来没有受伤。只是，当时那里并没有\n其他人，所以到底是被谁拉了一把呢……」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"e4e6832a01f138316d3fa7fc8072d1200d36913ca6f98f8563512ba8d33692e5","ja":"「あ、でも番組はうまくいきましたので。\n今日はお疲れさまでした～！」","zh":"「啊，不过节目很顺利呢。\n今天辛苦啦～！」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"12266cf328e88948aba55754c6c3148556e9131cc8cceed135ea8db1a26a9018","ja":"そういえば、暗くなったときに悲鳴が\n聞こえましたね。あれ、スタッフさんだったんだ。","zh":"这么说来，变暗的时候听到了\n尖叫声呢。原来那是工作人员啊。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"d5e84ea739a9dc722aaf86e1701f058b873f22f22d2595d520bdf039fe52304e","ja":"もう、心配してくれたのかもしれないけど、\n転ばせちゃうのはやりすぎだよ。めっ！","zh":"真是的，虽然你可能是出于担心，\n但害人摔倒也太过分了啦。不行哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"06af47a7e04c3e59116f25a74a08d7cb8f7ee45204603c98f7f5deb7cf00efd7","ja":"れ、麗花ちゃん……？\nもしかして、おばけとお話ししてるの……？","zh":"丽、丽花……？\n难道说，你是在跟幽灵说话吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"ba850afab3a0c70d3e2575b79e67d1eeab29d105a0bd2e2719bd12ab7ca66ba7","ja":"注意しただけですよ♪\nなんとなくこの辺にいそうだな～って思ったから。","zh":"只是提醒你一下而已啦♪\n因为我总觉得你大概就在这附近呢～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"0b68ac6dd28edb63c54593f5f75e23284b61a59f6e83eaedce92355d4f15788c","ja":"……あの、麗花ちゃん。\nこのあと一緒に帰ってもいいかしら……？","zh":"……那个，丽花。\n待会儿能和你一起回去吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1704.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"3401ce42f10a2d376173cd3c6b9247af3e24c28e6bbd05e29661b3c1f0ea2e0e","ja":"というかお願い！　しばらく一緒にいてちょうだい！\n私ひとりじゃ、怖くて夜道が歩けないわ！","zh":"我说，拜托了！稍微陪我一会儿嘛！\n我一个人走夜路害怕得很呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:19:09+00:00"}
